  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2012_che_a31.png\">\r\n\r\nFrom Henderson's equation,\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\np H &=p K_{a}+\\log \\frac{\\left.\\mid C H_{j} C O O N a\\right]}{\\left|C H_{3} C O O H\\right|} \\\\\r\n&=4.74+\\log \\frac{1}{1}=4.74\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$",
    "image": null
